  "notes": "3-year pot trial (2015-2017). Biochar rates expressed as % of wet soil weight (5/10/15/20%), not as t/ha - absolute rates depend on pot soil mass (35 kg wet soil per pot). One-time biochar application in June 2015. Yield data primarily from Figure 1 bar chart - exact values estimated. Text provides key values: Year 1 CK=4363 kg/ha, C-10/C-15 increased 29.1-34.2%. Year 2 CK=2332 kg/ha, C-15/C-20 increased 51.8-96.0%. Year 3 all treatments ~3000 kg/ha (no significant differences). Wheat straw biochar at 500-600C. Rice cultivar Huayou 14. 3 replicate pots per treatment."
}